%% Data Flow - Lambda Direct CRUD Operations

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant APIGW as Lambda Function URL<br/>(Public Endpoint)
    participant Lambda as Lambda Function<br/>(Private Subnet VPC)
    participant NAT as NAT Gateway
    participant RDS as RDS MySQL

    Note over Client,RDS: Lambda Direct Database Access

    Client->>+APIGW: POST https://xxx.lambda-url.../
    APIGW->>+Lambda: Invoke function

    Note over Lambda: Cold Start (if needed):<br/>- Provision ENI in VPC<br/>- Load pymysql layer<br/>- Initialize connection

    Lambda->>Lambda: Parse event body
    Lambda->>+RDS: SQL Query (via VPC ENI)
    RDS-->>-Lambda: Query result
    Lambda->>Lambda: Format response
    Lambda-->>-APIGW: {"statusCode": 200, "body": "..."}
    APIGW-->>-Client: HTTP Response

    Note over Lambda,NAT: For SQS/AWS API calls,<br/>Lambda routes through NAT Gateway
